Package: ggcordist
Title: Visualize Distributions of Covariance and Correlation Matrices
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Deven", "Gokhale", , "vgdeven@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Visualizes posterior (or prior) draws of covariance and
    correlation matrices, for example from a 'Stan' fit, using the
    four-layer approach of Tokuda, Goodrich, Van Mechelen, Gelman and
    Tuerlinckx, "Visualizing Distributions of Covariance Matrices".
    The layers are histograms of log standard deviations and
    correlations, bivariate scatterplots, equiprobability ellipses, and
    effective variance and effective dependence. Samplers for the
    Wishart, inverse-Wishart, scaled inverse-Wishart, LKJ and separation
    strategy distributions are included for reference and for
    prior-versus-posterior comparisons.
